ThinSincereQuivers -- creating and manipulating Toric Quivers
*************************************************************

Description
===========

ThinSincereQuivers is a package for creating and manipulating toric quivers.

For further details in the theory, we suggest the following articles and the
references within them:

  * Lutz Hille, Quivers, cones and polytopes,  (see
    https://doi.org/10.1016/S0024-3795(02)00406-8 ) Linear algebra and its
    applications 365 (2003): 215-237.
  * Mátyás Domokos and  Dániel Joó, On the equations and classification of
    toric quiver varieties (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1402.5096v1 ),
    Proceedings. Section A, Mathematics-The Royal Society of Edinburgh 146.2
    (2016): 265.

