    all possible subquivers of a given quiver
  * *note ToricQuiver == ToricQuiver: ToricQuiver == ToricQuiver, -- whether
    two toric quivers are equal.
  * "wallType(List,ToricQuiver)" -- see *note wallType: wallType, -- get the
    type of a wall for a given quiver

