|                                    | 0  0  1  1  |                          |
|                 Q0 => {0, 1, 2}                                             |
|                 Q1 => {{0, 1}, {0, 1}, {0, 2}, {0, 2}}                      |
|                 weights => {-19, 10, 9}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : ToricQuiver                                                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|"Random")                                                                    |
