================================

  * "isClosedUnderArrows(List,Matrix)"
  * "isClosedUnderArrows(List,ToricQuiver)"
  * "isClosedUnderArrows(Matrix,List)"
  * "isClosedUnderArrows(Matrix,ToricQuiver)"
  * "isClosedUnderArrows(ToricQuiver,ToricQuiver)"

