        stable, and false otherwise.

Description
===========

This function determines if a given subquiver is stable with respect to the
weight saved on Q. A subquiver SQ of the quiver Q is stable if for every subset
V of the vertices of Q that is also SQ-successor closed, the sum of the weights
associated to V is positive.

