wallQPlus -- get the partition of the set of vertices induced by a wall
***********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        wallQPlus (W)
  * Inputs:
      * W, a wall (missing documentation), 
  * Outputs:
      * QP, a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, of vertices contained in
        one of the two sets forming the partition induced by the wall W

Description
===========

Every wall can be represented uniquely by a partition of the vertices Q0 of Q
into two sets Qplus and Qminus. We denote the wall W by the subset of vertices
Qplus used for defining it.

+----------------------------------------------------------+
