AsSubquiver
***********

Description
===========

This is a symbol used to determine subquiver representation. Applying
AsSubquiver = true insures that the matrix representation of the subquiver is
the same size as the matrix original quiver. If false, then the subquiver is
returned as a standalone quiver represented by only the vertices and arrows
comprising the subquiver.

